sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dung
    participant UI as React Web App
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant Token as JwtTokenService
    participant Mail as GmailSmtpEmailService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    opt Giai doan 1: Yeu cau Quen mat khau (Forgot Password - BR-AUTH-06, BR-AUTH-09)
        User->>+UI: 1. Nhap Email can khoi phuc mat khau
        UI->>+Ctrl: 2. POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password { email }
        Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. ForgotPasswordAsync(email, clientIp, ct)
        Svc->>+DB: 4. SELECT * FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = @email
        
        alt Email khong ton tai hoac vua gui yeu cau < 60 giay (Rate Limit BR-AUTH-09)
            DB-->>Svc: 5a. Return null hoac tim thay recentToken (< 1 phut)
            Note over Svc: Ket thuc am tham (Silent Return) de chong do Email & chong Spam
        else Email hop le & thoa man Rate Limit
            DB-->>-Svc: 5b. Return User
            Svc->>+Token: 6b. Sinh rawToken (40 chars) & HashToken(rawToken)
            Token-->>-Svc: 7b. Return tokenHash
            Svc->>+DB: 8b. INSERT INTO password_reset_tokens (expires_at = NOW() + 15m)
            DB-->>-Svc: 9b. 1 row affected
            Svc->>+Mail: 10b. SendPasswordResetEmailAsync(email, fullName, rawToken)
            Mail-->>-Svc: 11b. Gui Email HTML chua Link & OTP qua Gmail SMTP (Port 587)
        end
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 12. Complete Task
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 13. 200 OK: Phản hồi đồng nhất (MSG-AUTH-05)
        UI-->>-User: 14. Thong bao kiem tra hop thu Email
    end

    opt Giai doan 2: Dat lai Mat khau moi (Reset Password - BR-AUTH-06)
        User->>+UI: 15. Mo link tu Email, nhap Mat khau moi (>= 6 ky tu)
        UI->>+Ctrl: 16. POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password { email, token, newPassword }
        Ctrl->>+Svc: 17. ResetPasswordAsync(request, ct)
        Svc->>+Token: 18. HashToken(request.Token)
        Token-->>-Svc: 19. Return tokenHash
        Svc->>+DB: 20. SELECT * FROM password_reset_tokens WHERE user_id = @uid AND token_hash = @hash AND used_at IS NULL
        
        alt Token khong ton tai hoac da qua 15 phut (ExpiresAt <= UtcNow)
            DB-->>Svc: 21a. Return null / Expired
            Svc-->>Ctrl: 22a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-06", "MSG-AUTH-06")
            Ctrl-->>UI: 23a. 400 Bad Request: Ma xac nhan khong hop le hoac het han
        else Token hop le
            DB-->>-Svc: 21b. Return tokenRecord
            Note over Svc: 1. Danh dau tokenRecord.UsedAt = UtcNow<br/>2. Bam mat khau moi BCrypt.HashPassword()<br/>3. Mo khoa tai khoan & Thu hoi TOAN BO RefreshTokens cu
            Svc->>+DB: 22b. UPDATE users, UPDATE password_reset_tokens, UPDATE refresh_tokens SET is_revoked = true
            DB-->>-Svc: 23b. Commit Transaction
            Svc-->>-Ctrl: 24b. Complete Task
            Ctrl-->>-UI: 25b. 200 OK: ApiResponse (MSG-GEN-01: Dat lai mat khau thanh cong)
            UI-->>-User: 26b. Chuyen huong ve trang Dang nhap
        end
    end

